    initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Faerie Dust], advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fey
    Disappearance], greater: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fey Glamour] Blood
    Magic\u2014Cloak of Ribbons Colorful fey ribbons dance around you. Either you
